# >>> NEAT-SUBSYSTEM:deep-signpost-retrieval-fusion rev=20
# NeatMemory 7.4.78.74 — source-grounded deep signposts + non-destructive lexical fusion
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live Art-of-War testing exposed two mechanical integration defects in .73:
#   1) deep generation overwrote the durable title+full-summary lexicon/hint instead of
#      augmenting it, so model wording could accidentally REMOVE literal recall terms;
#   2) signpost search required every query token to exist in one lexicon and ranked
#      query-local source matches before signpost-match strength, producing zero-result
#      long queries and allowing a weak endnote route to outrank a stronger signpost.
