# NeatMemory 7.4.78.151 — Capsule Mechanical Reporting Authority
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Assistant chooses what crosses a compact navigation boundary. Python exposes
# mechanical weight estimates, validates a hard budget, transports Assistant's own
# travel note/context items and selected read-only tools, and records what was
# actually admitted. Python never decides semantic relevance and never silently
# drops Assistant-selected luggage. The first live route is Books; Web/Research/Chat
# can use the same manifest contract. The note is ephemeral working state unless
# Assistant later chooses to persist something through an established authority.

