# NeatMemory 7.4.78.5 — read-only .nacb verification and durable receipts.
# Verification authenticates and validates the entire portable artifact without
# restoring it; creation and verification results become hash-chained evidence.
# NeatMemory 7.4.78.4 — encrypted-chat restart compatibility hotfix.
# A prior encrypted migration turns chat_messages into a compatibility view;
# the embedded legacy initializer must not attempt to index that logical view.
