# evidence loss, but exposed a semantic/transport mismatch: intention to make cards is not evidence-card creation. The same run
# accumulated ten exact source items and 141,615 source characters before a single 69,376-token Evidence Packing Gate, showing
# that multiple exact reads could pile up before the decision boundary. .38 therefore makes evidence packing atomic. Verified card
# creation itself becomes the cards decision only when those cards mechanically cover every exact source ref in the CURRENT pending
# event. Failed/partial cards leave that event visibly UNPACKED; navigation is not executed and the exact text remains visible for
# another packing attempt. Carry-full and external-only remain explicit Assistant choices. Python admits at most one exact-source tool
# call per capsule response, preserving response order and blocking additional parallel exact calls with explicit receipts until the
# admitted event is sealed. This is flow-control/transport enforcement only: Python still does not choose relevance, excerpts, source
# meaning, or evidence sufficiency. If the capsule round budget ends unexpectedly with an unsealed event, the full admitted evidence
# returns fail-safe. The capsule round ceiling rises from 6 to 10 so a five-evidence task can perform sequential inspect->pack cycles
# without forcing the last event home merely because the old transport-round ceiling expired. Journey/checkpoint governance advances.
#
# 7.4.78.37 EVIDENCE PACKING GATE + COMPACT CAPSULE DIAGNOSTICS follows the first live .36 selective-return test.
# The capsule/gate/offload path again worked, including five exact source items and 78,617 evidence characters offloaded to
# 3,185 handle characters, but Assistant created zero Evidence Cards naturally and the return bundle remained 86,215 versus an
# 86,216-character full-evidence baseline (0% practical return reduction). The capability therefore existed without a decision
# moment, exactly as the earlier passive Capsule Manifest had existed without natural activation. .37 makes the same principle
# explicit at the evidence boundary: once Assistant has inspected exact evidence, the next capsule decision exposes an Evidence Packing
# Gate. Before further navigation or return she must choose one mode for that inspected batch: bounded verbatim Evidence Card(s),
# explicitly carry the full source with her own reason, or explicitly leave the full source external and carry exact handles/refs
# with her own reason. She may combine that packing choice with the next navigation calls in the same response; Python does not
# choose evidence importance. Full evidence remains retained/reopenable and incomplete card coverage still fails safe to full return.
# The same live test also showed `/capsule status` itself had become a context bomb by repeating full candidate tool catalogs and
# packing cards. .37 therefore makes `/capsule status` and `/capsule last` compact by default and moves the complete dumps behind
# explicit `full` commands. This changes decision/observability transport only, not source authority, Assistant semantic ownership, or
# persistence. Journey/checkpoint governance advances for the new evidence-return decision boundary.
#
# 7.4.78.36 ASSISTANT EVIDENCE CARDS + SELECTIVE RETURN PACKING follows the live .35 five-principle Art of War test.
# The decision gate, manifest, and post-inspection evidence offload all passed, including 77,414 evidence characters offloaded to
