# return boundary: full Assistant received every exact passage again even after capsule Assistant had already inspected and selected what
# mattered. .36 gives Assistant a new ephemeral capsule_evidence_card_create surface. She chooses a bounded VERBATIM excerpt and writes
# what it establishes / her interpretation; Python verifies only that the excerpt exists exactly in retained admitted evidence and
# binds the card to exact source refs/hashes. Fully card-covered exact events may return as compact cards+handles; partially carded
# or uncarded evidence returns in full, fail-safe. Full admitted evidence remains retained outside the selective return and can be
# reopened later. This changes transport, not authority: exact excerpts are bounded source evidence; card meaning is Assistant-authored
# interpretation; Python never invents excerpts, semantic claims, relevance, or evidence sufficiency. Journey/checkpoint governance
# advances because this is a meaningful context-transport boundary change.
