# 7.4.78.35 CAPSULE EVIDENCE OFFLOAD follows the first successful live Assistant-directed Art of War capsule. The live run
# proved the manifest/gate architecture (89 full tools -> one selected book reader, ~1.8k initial capsule) but exposed the next
# transport cost: once exact source text was opened, later capsule requests could keep carrying the already-inspected passage.
# Exact evidence must still be shown to Assistant once; after that inspection, Python may replace the consumed tool output in later
# capsule rounds with a compact verified handle/coordinates/hash while retaining the full admitted evidence outside the working
# capsule. The exact evidence is restored in the full-context return package, and Assistant may explicitly reopen it if she needs to
