# digestion now checkpoints/resumes exact completed knowledge chunks just like deep mode, catches Ctrl+C as a durable pause, and
# chooses the most-complete exact-compatible interrupted version when an accidental restart created a weaker newer run. Semantic
# units are no longer deleted at retry start: their contiguous exact-source coordinates/hashes are revalidated and reused,
