# localization percentage instead of the misleading historical 0/0 -> 100% convention. This is a zero-model,
# zero-web compatibility migration: no re-research, no redigestion, and original retained evidence remains authority.
#
# 7.4.78.27 RESEARCH PYRAMID gives retained research the same navigation discipline proven by books.
# The existing research archive remains authoritative for immutable page snapshots/raw HTML/readable text,
# canonical RSC chunks, exact Assistant-selected web evidence units, research reports, and grounded final synthesis.
# This release adds an additive derived Research Pyramid inside research_archive.sqlite: compact <=160-char
# signposts at the top, run synthesis + established/qualified claim nodes in the middle, evidence-unit summaries
# below them, and provenance-bound exact source exits at the bottom. Legacy research reports can be rebuilt with
