# zero model/web/source calls and no redigest. Existing 7.4.78.15 signs are visibly
# stale until rebuilt. Future digest activation and current-summary repairs populate
# or refresh the lexicon automatically. Full summaries, source chunks, speech/context,
# personality, affect, provider routing, and authority boundaries remain unchanged.
#
