# 7.4.78.10 SEMANTIC BOUNDARY-REPAIR OUTPUT RECOVERY follows Steeve's first
# full Think Stats 2e PDF digest. All 84/84 immutable knowledge evidence batches
# completed, then semantic finalization asked Assistant to correct an invalid close
