# 7.4.68.1 OUTERMOST NORMAL-CHAT PROVENANCE GUARD follows the live 7.4.68.0 regression.
# `/version` explicitly confirmed that 7.4.68.0 was the running runtime, yet an ordinary
# Macbeth/Odyssey answer still ended with the old Research footer
# `record:research-report:RW-20260815-201705-a25e95d6`. This proved the remaining failure was
